"Announcements are added only from <b>Bernama</b> reports, and every one links to the Bernama article. A scheduled check reads Bernama every hour from 6 am to 7 pm, June to November (the haze season), and adds new closures and extensions. From December to May the check is paused.</p>": "Pengumuman ditambah hanya daripada laporan <b>Bernama</b>, dan setiap satu dipautkan kepada artikel Bernama. Semakan berjadual membaca Bernama setiap jam dari 6 pagi hingga 7 malam, Jun hingga November (musim jerebu), dan menambah penutupan serta lanjutan baharu. Dari Disember hingga Mei, semakan ini dihentikan sementara.</p>",
"Announcements reported between 6 am and 7 pm usually appear within an hour; ones reported later in the evening appear after the 6 am check. Always confirm with your school or the State Education Department (JPN).</p></div></details>": "Pengumuman yang dilaporkan antara 6 pagi dan 7 malam biasanya muncul dalam masa sejam; yang dilaporkan lewat petang akan muncul selepas semakan 6 pagi. Sentiasa sahkan dengan sekolah anda atau Jabatan Pendidikan Negeri (JPN).</p></div></details>",
